{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONFIGURE YOUR BLAMCON LIGHT GUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This utility will help you configure your Blamcon Light gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set Up Your Blamcon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Default Key Bindings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test Your Light Gun's Functions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blamcon ARC (Advanced Remote Console) allows you to customize all functions of your Blamcon Light Gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVANCED FUNCTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set functions like: Offscreen Reload, Sensor Layout, Emulation Mode, and even select between different cursor smoothing algorithms to play the way that's best for you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324170?t=1769633732","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769633732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324170/eb8a29af9198ca5aab7902db0636e61b458b9a56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769633732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324170/eb8a29af9198ca5aab7902db0636e61b458b9a56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769633732","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONFIGURE YOUR BLAMCON LIGHT GUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This utility will help you configure your Blamcon Light gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set Up Your Blamcon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Default Key Bindings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test Your Light Gun's Functions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_ta